### Electron Version

42.2.0

### What operating system(s) are you using?

macOS

### Operating System Version

macOS 14.7

### Expected Behavior

The single printed started value is true.

### Actual Behavior

The supplied app prints started false before stop is called.

### Testcase Gist URL

_No response_

### Additional Information

Save the following as main.cjs, install Electron 42.2.0 in the same directory with npm install electron@42.2.0, and run npx electron main.cjs. No renderer, preload, asset or service is needed.

```js
const { app, powerSaveBlocker } = require('electron');
app.whenReady().then(() => {
  const id = powerSaveBlocker.start('prevent-app-suspension');
  console.log('started', powerSaveBlocker.isStarted(id));
  powerSaveBlocker.stop(id);
  app.quit();
});
```
